{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51414","headline":"和李卫公漳浦驿留题 · 杨发","name":"和李卫公漳浦驿留题","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"南尽封邮见好山，苍苍桂岭类商颜，谁怜後夜思乡处，白草黄茅旧汉关。\n（《舆地纪胜》一三一《漳州》。\n又《康熙漳浦县志》十九《杂志·古蹟》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨发","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51414.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51414","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}